<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Freegold raises Sept qtr available profit.</title>
<headline>Freegold raises Sept qtr available profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit		 129.5  vs 126.5</p>
<p>    Capital spending		   9.1  vs   7.1</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 4,349,000 vs 4,570,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		 20,381 vs 21,261</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		     4.69 vs 4.65</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		   46,892 vs 42,973</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		54,955 vs 52,648</p>
<p>Full name: Free State Consolidated Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
